OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout skeleton discoveries
OL,4,Arise to 61
OL,5,
OL,6,FA total of 61 skeletons have now been
OL,7,Ffound underneath a roundabout during a
OL,8,F#65m city centre regeneration project,
OL,9,Fa council has said.
OL,11,FThe remains, along with tombs and
OL,12,Fburial chambers, were uncovered deep in
OL,13,Fthe site of Peterborough's Queensgate
OL,14,Froundabout, built on a former cemetery.
OL,16,FSkeletons first started being
OL,17,Fdiscovered in July during works on the
OL,18,FCity Link walkway project, which has
OL,19,Fnow been put back by a total of 11
OL,20,Fweeks due to the finds.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
