OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout skeleton discoveries
OL,4,Arise to 61
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngus Ellis, Labour councillor and
OL,7,Fcabinet member for transport at
OL,8,FPeterborough City Council, said: "We
OL,9,Fhave a duty to exhume the skeletons
OL,10,Fcarefully, ensuring we abide by the
OL,11,Fburial licence as instructed by the
OL,12,FMinistry of Justice."
